View ViewTableDELIVERYPREPARATION 'Préparation livraison (/*IDDELIVERY*/)' 'Préparation livraison (/*IDDELIVERY*/)'  255 255 255 _ 0 0 0 0 5 5 5 5 '[TRACELEVEL=(/*TRACELEVEL*/);TRACEFILE=;TOOLBAR=0;FLIPVERTICALLY=0;FLIPHORIZONTALLY=0;NATURESCALE=0;BESTFIT=1;SCROLLBAR=1;SHOWNAME=1;ZOOMOBJECT=;CURRENTPAGE=1;CLOSEEVENT=0;BKGROUNDCOLOR=(255 255 255);SCREENCOLOR=(255 255 255);PATHLINEWIDTH=9;PATHLINECOLOR=(0 0 0);PATHARROWWIDTH=15;PATHARROWCOLOR=(255 0 0);POEMSERVER=;MAPLOGFILE=;MATRIXCRITERION=Distance;MATRIXCOMPUTERADIUS=0.5;SPEEDKMHOUR=50;STRAIGHTDISTANCERATIO=1.4;SITEINTRADISTANCE=;MATRIXMAXCOMPUTEWIDTH=;NEIGHBOURHOOD=;MATRIXFILENAME=;MATRIXDIRECTORY=;GLOBALVARIABLE=0]'

Table tableDELIVERYPREPARATION _ _ 0 0 2000 500 \
"[]" - \
"[TITLE=Préparation livraison (/*IDDELIVERY*/);FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=10;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;LINESEPARATOR=\n;HEIGHT=30;BORDER=0;]"\
"[FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=9;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;]" \
"[FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=8;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;]" \
"[MARGIN=(10 0 10 0);FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=9;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;] \
COLUMNFILL={(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255)};\
ALIGNTEXT={Left,Left,Left,Right,Right,Right,Right,Right,Right,Left,Left,Left,Left}]"\
"[DATAOBJ=DELIVERYPREPARATION;FILLCOLOR=LINERGB]"

Data DELIVERYPREPARATION 'Préparation livraison (/*IDDELIVERY*/)' DELIVERYPREPARATION HTTPSQL 0 '[FIND={IDPRODUCT,DESIGNATION,IDORDER,NOLINE,QUANTITY,QUANTITYDEFECTIVE,WEIGHTUNIT,WEIGHT,WEIGHTPALLET,IDPACKING,NOPALLET,NOPALLETDELIVERY,STATE}]'   [DOUBLECLICK=] \
"[13;(string,IDPRODUCT,Produit,,10,,);(string,DESIGNATION,Désignation,,20,,);(string,IDORDER,Commande,,12,,);(int,NOLINE,No ligne,,10,,);(int,QUANTITY,Quantité,,10,,);(int,QUANTITYDEFECTIVE,Qté défectueuse,,15,,);(float,WEIGHTUNIT,Poids unité,,12,,);(float,WEIGHT,Poids,,10,,);(float,WEIGHTPALLET,Poids palette,,12,,);(string,IDPACKING,ID entrée,,11,,);(int,NOPALLET,No. palette,,11,,);(int,NOPALLETDELIVERY,Palette livraison,,19,,);(string,STATE,Etat,,20,,);(string,DATEEXPIRY,Date expiration,,8.0.80,1);\
(float,PRICE,Prix unitaire,,8.2.80,0);\
(float,DISCOUNT,Remise(%),,3.1.80,0);\
(string,LABELDISCOUNT,Libellé remise,,3.0.80,1);\
(string,FAMILY,Famille,,50.0.100,0);\
(string,IDCLIENT,ID client,,20.0.50,0);\
(string,POINTDELIVERY,Point livraison,,15.0.70,1);\
(string,ID,No livraison,,20.0.80,0);\
(string,DATEDELIVERY,Date livraison,,15.0.80,0);\
(string,IDORDERPRODUCTLINE,ID ligne,,20.0.80,0);\
(color,LINERGB,(255 255 255),,13.0.0);]" \
"SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);QUERY=SELECT \
		 d.id AS ID,\
		 d.idClient AS IDCLIENT,\
		 d.IdPointDelivery as POINTDELIVERY,\
		 P.Id as IDPRODUCT,\
		 P.Family as FAMILY,\
		 P.Designation as DESIGNATION,\
		 format(P.Weight,'0.0') as WEIGHTUNIT,\
		 DP.IdOrder AS IDORDER,format(DP.NoLine,'0') AS NOLINE,\
		 format(DP.PriceUnit,'0.000') as PRICE,\
		 format(DP.Discount,'0.0') as DISCOUNT,\
		 DP.LabelDiscount as LABELDISCOUNT,\
		 DP.DateDelivery as DATEDELIVERY,\
		 DP.Quantity AS QUANTITY,\
		 P.Weight*DP.QuantityReal as WEIGHT,\
		 DP.IdPacking as IDPACKING,\
		 IIF(DP.NoPallet is NULL,0,DP.NoPallet) as NOPALLET,\
		 IIF(DP.NoPalletDelivery is NULL,0,DP.NoPalletDelivery) as NOPALLETDELIVERY,\
		 (trim(DP.IdOrder)+'-'+trim(DP.IdProduct)+'-'+format(DP.NoLine,'0')) as IDORDERPRODUCTLINE,\
		 (select DateExpiration from PALLET_PRODUCT LP where  LP.IdPacking=DP.IdPacking and LP.NoPallet=DP.NoPallet and LP.IdProduct=DP.IdProduct) as DATEEXPIRY,\
		 (select format(sum(DP0.QuantityReal*P0.Weight),'0.0') from DELIVERY_PRODUCT DP0 inner join PRODUCT P0 on P0.Id=DP0.IdProduct where DP0.IdDelivery=d.Id and DP0.NoPalletDelivery=DP.NoPalletDelivery) as WEIGHTPALLET,\
		  0 as INDELIVERY,\
		 IIF(DP.IdPacking='STOCK','Attent Retrait du Stock','OK') AS STATE, \
		 IIF(DP.IdPacking='STOCK','(250 220 20)','(120 255 120)') AS LINERGB \
		 FROM DELIVERY d, DELIVERY_PRODUCT DP, PRODUCT P \
		 WHERE d.Id=DP.IdDelivery\
		 and P.Id=DP.IdProduct\
		 and d.Id in ((/*IDDELIVERY*/)) \
		 \
		 UNION ALL SELECT\
		 d.id AS ID,\
		 d.idClient AS IDCLIENT,\
		 d.IdPointDelivery as POINTDELIVERY,\
		 P.Id as IDPRODUCT,\
		 P.Family as FAMILY,\
		 P.Designation as DESIGNATION,\
		 format(P.Weight,'0.0') as WEIGHTUNIT,\
		 ' ' as IDORDER, 0 AS NOLINE,\
		 '0.000' as PRICE,\
		 '0.0' as DISCOUNT,\
		 ' ' as LABELDISCOUNT,\
		 ' ' as DATEDELIVERY,\
		 PaPr.QuantityStock AS QUANTITY,\
		 P.Weight*PaPr.QuantityStock as WEIGHT,\
		 PaPr.IdPacking as IDPACKING,\
		 PaPr.NoPallet as NOPALLET,\
		 ' ' as NOPALLETDELIVERY,\
		 ' ' as IDORDERPRODUCTLINE,\
		 PaPr.DateExpiration as DATEEXPIRY,\
		 (select format(sum(PaPr0.QuantityStock*P0.Weight),'0.0') from PALLET_PRODUCT PaPr0 inner join PRODUCT P0 on P0.Id=PaPr0.IdProduct where PaPr0.IdPacking=PaPr.IdPacking and PaPr0.NoPallet=PaPr.NoPallet) as WEIGHTPALLET,\
		 1 as INDELIVERY,\
		 'A Retirer' AS STATE, \
		 '(255 255 255)' AS LINERGB \
		 FROM DELIVERY d, PALLET_PRODUCT PaPr, PRODUCT P \
		 WHERE PaPr.IdProduct in (select DP.IdProduct from DELIVERY_PRODUCT DP where d.Id=DP.IdDelivery and DP.IdPacking='STOCK')\
		 and P.Id=PaPr.IdProduct\
		 and PaPr.QuantityStock>0 and d.Id in ((/*IDDELIVERY*/)) \
		 Order BY FAMILY, DESIGNATION, INDELIVERY,IDORDER, NOLINE, DATEEXPIRY"


Script ModifyPallet  'Modifier palette livraison' _ 61 'Modifier palette livraison' _ 'tableDELIVERYPREPARATION' '( 0 0 0 0 )' '[0,(0 0 0),(255 255 255);;Arial,,-20;(C M),(2 2 2 2)]' _ _  '[SINGLESEL=0;COUNT=2;NETNCL=HTTP;SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);MESSAGE=0;CANCEL=0;SKIP=0;WAITCURSOR=0;]' \
Ncl '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)' '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)Model\Interaction\Edit\Delivery\UpdateDeliveryProductPallet.n' '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)ncl.cfg' _ _ _ 1 \
 '(/*SERVERPORT*/) (/*USERID*/)  {/*Selected(DELIVERYPREPARATION;2;(string,ID);(string,IDORDERPRODUCTLINE);)*/} \
{/*Input(Modifier Palette;1;\
(int,PALLET,Numéro palette,1,10.0.580,0);\
)*/}\
'\
Reload _ _ _

